  "bodyHash": "cc6b57da2f03e4af",
  "content": "\n\n<p>摘要</p>\n<p><strong><br>斯基比迪馬桶已經入侵了。</strong></p>\n<p>它們會在夜晚或黑暗處生成，威脅玩家的生命安全……</p>\n<p>它們是威力強大的怪物，物理攻擊力極高，若不謹慎應對，一擊就能將你擊殺。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>但別放棄。</p>\n<p>你擁有與它們戰鬥的技巧。</p>\n<p>遊戲中有許多強力道具，例如拔刀劍、強效盔甲與槍械。</p>\n<p>此外，你可以在遊戲一開始就獲得拔刀劍。它非常強力，絕對能從開局到末期都成為你的得力助手。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你能在這場生存挑戰中存活下來嗎……？</p>\n<p>不，我們一定要存活下去！<br><br><strong>請查看以下網站以獲取更多進程指南！<br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>令人聞風喪膽的斯基比迪馬桶已經入侵了 Minecraft。 </span><span><span>你</span> <span>仍然</span> <span>必須</span> <span>活下去</span><span>。</span> </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>下方將提供簡短的進程說明與一些技巧。 </span></p>\n<p><br><em><strong>如果附近沒有村莊</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>1. 重生後請立即砍伐樹木。 </span><span><span>你</span> <span>沒有</span> <span>時間</span> <span>可以</span> <span>浪費</span><span>。</span> </span><span><span>我們</span> <span>必須</span> <span>在</span> <span>它們</span> <span>出現</span> <span>的</span> <span>夜晚</span> <span>前</span> <span>完成</span> <span>一切</span><span>。</span><span>...</span></span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>2. 如果有綿羊，請立即將其擊殺！ </span><span><span>這</span> <span>將</span> <span>避免</span> <span>它們</span> <span>出現</span> <span>時</span> <span>那</span> <span>令人恐懼</span> <span>的</span> <span>夜晚</span><span>。</span> </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>3. 製作你的工具！ </span><span><span>製作</span> <span>一把</span> <span>木製</span> <span>斧頭</span> <span>和</span> <span>一把</span> <span>木製</span> <span>鎬</span><span>。</span> </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span><span>.</span> <span>專注於</span> <span>擊殺</span> <span>綿羊</span> <span>和</span> <span>牛</span> <span>等生物</span><span>。</span> </span><span><span>綿羊</span> <span>可</span> <span>用來</span> <span>製作床</span><span>，</span> <span>牛</span> <span>則可用來</span> <span>製作皮革盔甲</span><span>。</span> </span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong><span><span>如果</span> <span>附近有</span> <span>村莊</span> </span></strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>.</span> <span>在</span> <span>村莊</span> <span>上設置</span> <span>JourneyMap</span> <span>傳送點</span><span>。</span> </span><span><span>（</span><span>不要</span> <span>開啟</span> <span>傳送到</span> <span>功能</span><span>，</span> <span>因為</span> <span>這會</span> <span>破壞</span> <span>遊戲平衡</span><span>。</span></span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>2. 村莊裡已有床和食物，因此無需擔心這些，但務必記得製作盔甲。 </span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong><span>自此</span> <span>之後</span><span>，</span> <span>通用</span> <span>的</span> <span>做法如下</span></strong></em></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>.</span> <span>製作</span> <span>煤</span> <span>或</span> <span>木炭</span><span>。</span> </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>2. 製作一把劍。 </span><span><span>配方</span> <span>請見</span> <span>下圖</span><span>。</span> </span><span><span>點擊</span> <span>此處</span> <span>觀看</span> <span>關於</span> <span>拔刀劍</span> <span>模組</span> <span>的介紹影片</span><span>！</span> </span><span><span>拔刀劍</span> <span>將</span> <span>陪伴</span> <span>你</span> <span>從</span> <span>遊戲</span> <span>開局</span> <span>直到</span> <span>結局</span><span>。</span><span>...</span><span>.</span> </span><span><span>（</span><span>請注意</span> <span>它</span> <span>有</span> <span>一些小特性</span><span>。</span> </span><span>總之，它在初期將是最強的武器……）</span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>.</span> <span>取得</span> <span>圓石</span><span>：</span> <span>‼︎</span> <span>你可以</span> <span>透過</span> <span>挖掘地面</span> <span>或</span> <span>挖掘山丘</span> <span>來獲得圓石</span><span>。</span> </span><span>你可以製作鏟子來縮短採集時間。 </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>4. 如果發現銅、鐵等礦石，請將其挖掘出來。 </span><span>你也可以用它們製作盔甲和其他物品，非常實用。 </span><span><span>若找不到</span><span>，</span> <span>就去擊殺牛</span><span>吧</span><span>。</span> </span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>技巧</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>・知名工業模組 Create Mod 已包含在內。 </span><span><span>它</span> <span>非常</span> <span>實用</span><span>，</span> <span>因為</span> <span>它</span> <span>能</span> <span>無限生產鐵</span><span>。</span> </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span><span>・</span> <span>村莊裡有士兵和鐵魔像</span><span>，</span> <span>但敵人的實力恐怕比士兵和鐵魔像還要強大</span><span>。</span> </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>・門毫無用處，因為它們會直接摧毀門。 </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span><span>・</span> <span>將村莊圍起來</span><span>。</span> </span><span><span>但請小心</span><span>，</span> <span>它們會摧毀門禁系統</span><span>。</span> </span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span><span>・</span> <span>有許多模組可添加更強力的武器</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><br><em><strong>請參考以下連結以查看所包含的模組清單。</strong></em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/skibidi-toilet-all-in-one-packs/relations/dependencies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/skibidi-toilet-all-in-one-packs/relations/dependencies</a><br></strong></em></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>&nbsp;加入 Discord 社群！！！</em></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/bVaHJN3uUV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/bVaHJN3uUV</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
